## 3. What I Built

A fully functional login page with a centered card layout. Beyond the basic requirements, I added several extra features to make the page feel like a real product:

- **Email validation** — checks for empty field and proper format (`user@domain.com`) using regex
- **Strong password validation** — enforces 5 rules: minimum 8 characters, one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one number, and one symbol
- **Live password strength bar** — updates in real time as the user types, showing Weak / Medium / Strong with colour feedback
- **Show/hide password toggle** — eye icon button switches between `type="password"` and `type="text"`
- **Forgot Password modal** — clicking the link opens an overlay modal with its own email input and validation, simulates sending a reset link
- **Apply Here modal** — clicking "Apply here" opens a full internship application form with first name, last name, email, role, and a message field, all with validation
- **Toast notifications** — a small notification slides in from the top of the screen for success and error feedback
- **Responsive layout** — tested at 1280px, 480px, and 360px widths

