## 7. JavaScript Logic Summary

```
Login form submit
  └── clear previous errors
  └── validate email (empty check → format check)
  └── validate password (empty → length → uppercase → lowercase → number → symbol)
  └── if errors → show inline messages, stop
  └── if valid → show loading spinner → simulate login → show toast → reset form

Password input (live)
  └── count how many of 5 rules pass
  └── update strength bar width and color
  └── update label text (Weak / Medium / Strong)

Forgot password modal
  └── open on link click
  └── close on X or outside click
  └── validate email on submit → show toast → close modal

Apply form modal
  └── open on "Apply here" click
  └── close on X or outside click
  └── validate all 5 fields on submit
  └── message must be at least 20 characters
  └── show success toast → close modal → reset form
```

